WEBVTT

00:00:00.179 --> 00:00:03.489
Print <b>labels</b> with price and barcode

00:00:03.556 --> 00:00:06.468
Choose the size of your label sheet

00:00:06.543 --> 00:00:11.214
Changed prices today? Filter <b>Modificados hoy</b> (changed today)

00:00:11.281 --> 00:00:14.358
Check the ones you want, or uncheck the ones you don't

00:00:14.431 --> 00:00:20.144
And print: MiCaja tells you how many sheets you will use
